  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Kūbala 20",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Minzī kūfuma ng'wiwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'weji gwa kabīlī, a Baisilaeli bakashika ng'witogolo lya Zini, bikala ipandī lya Kadeeshi. Aho balī henaho ū Miliamu ūzumalīka ūjīkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūgayiwa minzī a banhū, būbikuunūkīla a ba Musa nū Alooni kūbahoogoja mihayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayūduguma balīhaya, “Yalī hambū hambū ūlū nise nitwachīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, aho bakacha a bichiswi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibūlī mukabenha kū matogolo kūūnū a banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA? Kwiza kūtūbūlaga hamò nī mitugo jise? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibūlī mukatwīnja ī Misili kūtwenha kūūnū kū makoye gīkī? Ū kūūnū ndūhū na būsīga nūūlū mizeituni, nūūlū migūnda ya mizabibu; ndūhū nūūlū kī, nūūlū mitī ya makomamanga ītīho; na a minzī ga kūng'wa na a gene gatīho!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa nū Alooni bīnga a hibità lya banhū, būja kū nyango gwa iheema lya kwibilingīla, būūkagwa bachimīgije ū būshū hasī. Hūna ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lyiyoolecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gūsolage ū nang'ha, hūna ū bebe nū nkūlūyo ū Alooni mubakūminge hamò a banhū; hanuma ūshiyombye ī shiganga īsho, shipuumunhe a minzī gasho balolile. Gakwigela minzī kūfuma ū mu shiganga, ūbinhe a banhū, bapandīke sha kūng'wa hamò nī mitugo jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Musa ūgūsola ū nang'ha, wīnga nago ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA gīt'ūmo walī wanagīīlīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa nū Alooni būbakuminga a banhū bbihī nī liwe lyenīlo, hūna ū Musa ūbawīla, “Alidegelekagi lūūlū bing'we balema kwigwa; ī gete hamo tūng'winhe minzī kūfuma ū mu shiganga īshi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūgūnunja ng'wigūlya ū nkono gwakwe, ūshitūla ī shigana na nang'ha gwakwe ng'hangala ibīlī. Gūūpumunhīka minzī, a banhū būng'wa hamò nī mitugo jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA ūbawīla a ba Musa nū Alooni, “A bing'we mutūūlingīja ī libità lyenīlī ū mu sī īyo nalībinha, nguno mutanisanije na kūninha ikūjo ū kū būtongi wa banhū bane a Baisilaeli gīkī nalī ng'wela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī genayo hū gene ayo gaalī ga Meliba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Meliba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū mu Shihebulania a makūlū gaho; kūduguma.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūko Baisilaeli bakandugumīla SEEBA, nang'hwe wiyoolecha ū kūbo gīkī alī ng'wela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baedomu kūbahangīja Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Musa ūtūma nhūng'wa kūlī ntemi wa Edomu alīhaya, “A ba numba ya ng'wana wa ng'wing'we Isilaeli balīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū bebe ūgadeebile a makoye ayo gaatūpandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakūlūgenji bise bakaja Misili, būūkalobela, tūbiza ba kwenūko myaka mingī. Hanuma ya makanza a bana Misili bandya kūbaluhya a bakūlūgenji bise, pye na a bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho twanīlīīla ū SEEBA, ūtwigwa ū mu būlīji wise, ūtūma malaika kwiza kūtwīnja ū mu sī ya Misili. Ī haha tūlī ha Kadeeshi aha, nzengo ūyo gūbīmbīkanilwe nī sī yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūlīkūlomba ūtūzunīlīje tūbītīle ū mu sī yako. Ū mu migūnda ya shilīwa shako tūtūūbīta mo, nūūlū ū mu migūnda ya mizabibu, nūūlū minzī tūtūūng'wa kūfuma mu lwinzī lwako lose lose. Tūkūbīta ng'wikūūwa dūhū, tūtūūgalūka kūja kū būlyo nūūlū kū lūmoso, kūshisha tūbīte ū mu sī yako.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a ba numba ya ng'wa Edomu būshosha, “Mutizūgima kūbīta ūmu; ūlū mulagaganīje, tūkūmusanga bo shilanga kwiza kūlwa ning'we dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bibūūla hangī balīhaya, “A bise tūkūbīta ng'wikūūwa dūhū, nahene ī mitugo jise ūlū jūūng'wa minzī ging'we tūkūmulīpīla; nūūlū a bise benekīlī ūlū tūūgang'wa tūkūlīpa. A bise tūtogilwe kūbīta dūhū bo magūlū, tūtī na gūngī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūshosha hangī balīhaya, “Yaya gete mutizūgema ū kūbīta.” Ī likanza lyenīlo a Baedomu būfuma na ibità itaale no, hangī lya nguzu; būbasanga a Baisilaeli kūjūūlwa nabo būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īkī a Baedomu bakalema gīkī batizūbīta ū mu sī yabo, a Baisilaeli būgalūka būbīngīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alooni ūcha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libità lya Baisilaeli ī lyose lyūbūūka lyīngile ī Kadeeshi, lyūja lyūkashika kū lūgūlū lwa Hooli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī ū kū lūgūlū lwa Hooli, a ha lūbīmbī lwa sī ya Baedomu, ū SEEBA ūbawīla a ba Musa nū Alooni gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Alooni akūtwalwa kū banhū bakwe. Atingīla ū mu sī īyo nalībinha a Baisilaeli, nguno a bose būbīlī wing'we mukaleka ū kwīta īyo naalī naamulagīla kwīta ū kū minzī ga Meliba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū bebe nsolage ū Alooni nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Elieza wize nabo kū lūgūlū lwa Hooli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūng'wīngīja ū Alooni ī shizwalo shakwe ūnzwalīkīje ng'witūnja wakwe Elieza; nguno ū Alooni akūtwalwa kū banhū bakwe, akūchīla ū kū lūgūlū lwenūlo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa wīta gīt'ūmo SEEBA akanagīīla, būja ū kū lūgūlū lwa Hooli, pye a banhū balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
